iary equation results in\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\lambda -7)^{2} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =7$ is a repeated root of the auxiliary equation." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063871/state.json" "file_sha256" "e73e7ae59f61c6f3185b23239fe580ad4bcebe310317fb318db369ebaebca9f8"} {"question" "q-130130" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063871/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5716e843d004aee90df80f9a99a117edc8c2365c713bab3e5b490fdeeedb9156"} {"question" "q-130130" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063871/state.json" "file_sha256" "e73e7ae59f61c6f3185b23239fe580ad4bcebe310317fb318db369ebaebca9f8"} {"question" "q-130130" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-14"] ["math" "-7"] ["math" "7"] ["text" "$-14$ or $7$"] ["text" "$-7$ or $7$"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063871/state.json" "file_sha256" "e73e7ae59f61c6f3185b23239fe580ad4bcebe310317fb318db369ebaebca9f8"} {"question" "q-130130" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "7"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063871/state.json" "file_sha256" "e73e7ae59f61c6f3185b23239fe580ad4bcebe310317fb318db369ebaebca9f8"} {"question" "q-130133" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider the equation ${y}^{″}+10{y}^{′}+25y=0.$ If $y={e}^{\\lambda x}$ is a solu